<attrib name="id" value="sch.4-sec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2</no><heading guid="_9ef26470-4bd0-4555-9ae9-b318aba02f5d"
id="sch.4-sec.2-he"><b>Reservation of lands as national
parks</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sch.4-sec.2-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_3b606c13-81b7-4067-9444-c62d0cfd2c38"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.4-sec.2-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The lands reserved as national parks by section 5
(1) and (2) shall, for the purposes of the <legref refid="act-1974-080"
jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>National Parks
and Wildlife Act 1974</i></name></legref> (other than section 35 of that Act),
be deemed to have been so reserved by proclamation made under section 33 (2)
of that Act.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sch.4-sec.2-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6c9f9f17-0081-45c5-8c5e-16178e2e0fa1"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.4-sec.2-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The land reserved as parts of national parks by
section 5 (3) and (4) shall, for the purposes of the <legref
refid="act-1974-080" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>National Parks and Wildlife Act 1974</i></name></legref>,
(other than section 35 of that Act), be deemed to have been so reserved by
proclamation made under section 33 (3) of that Act.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sch.4-sec.2-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6a9fbf2d-1af0-456f-9ab7-a4e2d19a26a3"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.4-sec.2-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A reference in the <legref refid="act-1974-080"
jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>National Parks
and Wildlife Act 1974</i></name></legref> (other than in section 35 of that
Act), to the publication of a proclamation under section 33 (2) or (3) of that
Act shall, in relation to a reservation referred to in section 5, be deemed to
be a reference to the enactment of this Act.</txt></block></tier>
</level>
</content>


<content type="auto-inserted">

<level type="clause" id="sch.4-sec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_4804cb1a-cdb6-49a5-a77b-a3cef87242be"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.4-sec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_75ec3280-4184-4bb1-a532-b1ae91ef796b"
id="sch.4-sec.3-he"><b>Names of national parks</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A name assigned to a national park by section 5
(1) or (2) shall be deemed to have been assigned to that park by a
proclamation referred to in section 36 (a) of the <legref refid="act-1974-080"
jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>National Parks
and Wildlife Act 1974</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></level>
</content>


<content type="auto-inserted">

<level type="clause" id="sch.4-sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_3b5758fa-3f54-44a3-a219-ce4e84508847"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.4-sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_1f2fe251-1758-4294-a2e0-c29b95983b80"
id="sch.4-sec.4-he"><b>Existing leases under the <legref refid="act-1916-055"
jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Forestry Act
1916</i></name></legref></b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Section 42 (2) of the <legref
refid="act-1974-080" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>National Parks and Wildlife Act 1974</i></name></legref>,
applies to and in respect of a lease under the <legref refid="act-1916-055"
jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Forestry Act
1916</i></name></legref>, being a lease:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_6ec55c4f-8788-42d2-a209-223b98aa78e2" id="sch.4-sec.4-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">affecting any of the lands described in Schedule
1 or 2, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_79ee4bbe-d5e6-45e4-81d3-8f30deafb61b" id="sch.4-sec.4-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">current and in force immediately before the
commencement of this Act,</txt></block></li></list>

<txt break.before="1">in the same way as it applies to a licence or permit
under the <legref refid="act-1916-055" jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Forestry Act 1916</i></name></legref>,
affecting lands within a national park.</txt></block></level>
</content>


<content type="auto-inserted">

<level type="clause" id="sch.4-sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_efe0506f-18f6-4c0f-aff6-e8facbe0facb"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.4-sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_2c5b20a2-49f3-49bd-a76d-f6a97fa1da97"
id="sch.4-sec.5-he"><b>Administration of existing leases
etc</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sch.4-sec.5-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_ba09bb8d-25b6-4d1e-bbe7-be7f9887ad2f"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.4-sec.5-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this clause, <defterm type="definition"
guid="_986ea397-fcaa-43e4-8b37-2a08c7245a48"
id="sch.4-sec.5-def.existinginterest"><b><i>existing
interest</i></b></defterm> means a lease, licence, permit or occupancy current
and in force immediately before the commencement of this
Act.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sch.4-sec.5-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_5634a8f0-ac7a-49d7-b408-d7957d357428"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.4-sec.5-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The administration of matters relating to
existing interests, to the extent that those interests affect any of the lands
described in Schedules 1 and 2, is vested in the Minister administering the
<legref refid="act-1974-080" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>National Parks and Wildlife Act
1974</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sch.4-sec.5-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_9ed66e7d-972f-45c4-8922-7dd655cc08cc"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.4-sec.5-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">For the purposes of subclause (2), the Minister
administering the <legref refid="act-1974-080" jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>National Parks and Wildlife Act
1974</i></name></legref>, shall have:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_874c69be-a0df-42ad-b9ec-988bcf630136" id="sch.4-sec.5-ssec.3-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">in respect of existing interests under the
<legref refid="act-1916-055" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Forestry Act 1916</i></name></legref>&#8212;the powers of
the Minister administering that Act, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_512f9bc7-5e11-4561-9b2c-3525a409e859" id="sch.4-sec.5-ssec.3-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">in respect of existing interests under the
<legref refid="act-2016-058" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Crown Land Management Act 2016</i></name></legref>&#8212;the
powers of the Minister administering that Act.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>
</level>
</content>


<content type="auto-inserted">

<level type="clause" id="sch.4-sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_c614345c-06f5-4925-9f62-ae40172bfd57"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.4-sec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading guid="_e6f26421-1b3d-4351-beb1-b24ab2dda5ed"
id="sch.4-sec.6-he"><b>Saving</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A revocation effected by this Act does not affect
anything done or omitted to be done before the commencement of this
Act.</txt></block></level>
</content>


